{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/dropReports","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"A report of each drop of held or recovered records, in the order they happen.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:8Trackers7ConsentV11dropReports11AsyncQueues0E5QueueVyAA0B10DropReportOGvp","modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","title":"dropReports","symbolKind":"property","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Consent.swift#L117","fileName":"Consent.swift"},"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","text":"AsyncQueue"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers17ConsentDropReportO","text":"ConsentDropReport"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncQueue","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ConsentDropReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers17ConsentDropReportO","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/ConsentDropReport"},{"kind":"text","text":"> { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reports wait until they are read. A record dropped for room is reported as it is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dropped; while that report waits unread, later ones merge into it, one report counting"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them all across their timestamps. So the reports waiting unread hold at most one overflow"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"report between any two others (denials and finished trackers), however many events"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"overflow. The sequence ends once the consent is gone and every report has been read."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"One task reads the reports at a time. The first iterator to read holds them until its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"iteration ends or it is released; a second reader meanwhile waits its turn, logging a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"warning once, then reads on from the next report, so the first gets every report in order."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A reader cancelled while it waits returns "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/consent\/dropreports"]}],"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/ConsentDropReport":{"abstract":[{"text":"Records a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent","type":"reference"},{"text":" dropped before they were delivered, and why.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/ConsentDropReport","kind":"symbol","title":"ConsentDropReport","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ConsentDropReport"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ConsentDropReport"}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consentdropreport"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers":{"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","abstract":[{"text":"The tracker app code tracks events with, and what it applies to each event before it is delivered: enrichers, samplers and consent.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackers","title":"Trackers","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","type":"topic"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Consent":{"abstract":[{"text":"The user’s consent, category by category, which a tracker given it applies to every event.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent","type":"topic","title":"Consent","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Consent","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Consent","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consent"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Consent/dropReports":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consent\/dropreports","abstract":[{"text":"A report of each drop of held or recovered records, in the order they happen.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dropReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"ConsentDropReport","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers17ConsentDropReportO"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/dropReports","title":"dropReports","role":"symbol"},"doc://AsyncQueues/documentation/AsyncQueues/AsyncQueue":{"url":"\/documentation\/asyncqueues\/asyncqueue","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":